{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_01",
      "hash": "69183b2fbfcbb2c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我说，我的小呆呆兽呀！\\n真是拿你没辙……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_02",
      "hash": "6918382fbfcbadb0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀，如果你不介意的话，\\n可以帮我个忙吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_03",
      "hash": "6918392fbfcbaf63",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你应该很忙吧……\\n真是抱歉啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_04",
      "hash": "69183e2fbfcbb7e2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我接下来想去一趟\\n深灰博物馆。\\c\\n可是我的小呆呆兽\\n一步都不肯动呢……"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub087_yadon_01",
      "hash": "f0f118be8033672a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆兽：呆喔～～"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_05",
      "hash": "69183f2fbfcbb995",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在我去博物馆的期间，你能不能\\n帮我照看一下小呆呆兽呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_09",
      "hash": "6918432fbfcbc061",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊，是你！\\n你可以再帮我\\r\\n照看一下小呆呆兽吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub087_select_01",
      "hash": "087a940740025655",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub087_select_02",
      "hash": "087a91074002513c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "对不起"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_06",
      "hash": "69183c2fbfcbb47c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "帮大忙了！\\n那我的小呆呆兽\\r\\n就拜托你照看一下下啦。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub087_yadon_02",
      "hash": "f0f117be80336577",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……　……　……\\n……　……　……"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_01",
      "hash": "a2604769f3459b22",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆兽恍惚地注视着前方……"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_02",
      "hash": "a2604669f345996f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆兽一直无所事事……"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_03",
      "hash": "a2604569f34597bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆兽站在那里，\\n看上去很舒服的样子……"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_04",
      "hash": "a2604469f3459609",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆兽看上去\\n像是在思考着些什么……"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_05",
      "hash": "a2604369f3459456",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆兽好像第一次意识到了\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]的存在……"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_06",
      "hash": "a2604269f34592a3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆兽用余光\\n看了看[VAR TRNAME(0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_07",
      "hash": "a2604169f34590f0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆兽有一点点\\n在意[VAR TRNAME(0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_08",
      "hash": "a2605069f345aa6d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆兽似乎\\n开始习惯[VAR TRNAME(0000)]了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_09",
      "hash": "a2604f69f345a8ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "总觉得呆呆兽看上去挺开心……"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_10",
      "hash": "a25cc269f342834c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "能和[VAR TRNAME(0000)]在一起，\\n呆呆兽看上去挺高兴！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_11",
      "hash": "a25cc369f34284ff",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……和小呆呆兽\\n共度了一段悠闲的时光！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_07",
      "hash": "69183d2fbfcbb62f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "谢谢你能\\n帮我照看小呆呆兽。\\c\\n这是我的一点心意，\\n你愿意收下吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_12",
      "hash": "a25cc469f34286b2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从阿姨那里\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_08",
      "hash": "6918422fbfcbbeae",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "如果你愿意，\\n我以后还会拜托你的。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_087_max",
      "hash": "48df59edae2527ff"
    }
  ]
